[{"command": "add", "parent": "/body", "type": "paragraph", "props": {"text": "Classroom AI 合成教学示例", "style": "Title", "font": "Calibri", "font.ea": "Microsoft YaHei", "size": "23pt", "bold": "true", "spaceAfter": "8pt", "lineSpacing": "1.25x", "color": "17324D"}}, {"command": "add", "parent": "/body", "type": "paragraph", "props": {"text": "分布式大数据计算 · 数据分区与聚合", "style": "Subtitle", "font": "Calibri", "font.ea": "Microsoft YaHei", "size": "15pt", "bold": "false", "spaceAfter": "8pt", "lineSpacing": "1.25x", "color": "263648"}}, {"command": "add", "parent": "/body", "type": "paragraph", "props": {"text": "来源：DEMO-DATA-20261012-v1 | 版本：v1 | 日期：2026-10-12", "style": "Normal", "font": "Calibri", "font.ea": "Microsoft YaHei", "size": "9pt", "bold": "false", "spaceAfter": "8pt", "lineSpacing": "1.25x", "color": "263648"}}, {"command": "add", "parent": "/body", "type": "paragraph", "props": {"text": "此文件由数据治理脚本生成，用于演示资源、版本与预览功能。课程案例、练习和评价均为合成示例，不是学校正式教学材料、培养方案或真实师生记录。", "style": "Normal", "font": "Calibri", "font.ea": "Microsoft YaHei", "size": "11pt", "bold": "false", "spaceAfter": "8pt", "lineSpacing": "1.25x", "color": "263648"}}, {"command": "add", "parent": "/body", "type": "paragraph", "props": {"text": "学习目标", "style": "Heading1", "font": "Calibri", "font.ea": "Microsoft YaHei", "size": "18pt", "bold": "true", "spaceAfter": "8pt", "lineSpacing": "1.25x", "color": "17324D"}}, {"command": "add", "parent": "/body", "type": "paragraph", "props": {"text": "理解课程相关概念，通过可复核案例分析并解释结果；用讨论、实验记录和简要说明展示学习过程。", "style": "Normal", "font": "Calibri", "font.ea": "Microsoft YaHei", "size": "11pt", "bold": "false", "spaceAfter": "8pt", "lineSpacing": "1.25x", "color": "263648"}}, {"command": "add", "parent": "/body", "type": "paragraph", "props": {"text": "案例任务", "style": "Heading1", "font": "Calibri", "font.ea": "Microsoft YaHei", "size": "18pt", "bold": "true", "spaceAfter": "8pt", "lineSpacing": "1.25x", "color": "17324D"}}, {"command": "add", "parent": "/body", "type": "paragraph", "props": {"text": "1. 将合成订单按键分区，说明每个分区的处理职责。", "style": "Normal", "font": "Calibri", "font.ea": "Microsoft YaHei", "size": "11pt", "bold": "false", "spaceAfter": "8pt", "lineSpacing": "1.25x", "color": "263648"}}, {"command": "add", "parent": "/body", "type": "paragraph", "props": {"text": "2. 设计映射与聚合步骤，计算各类订单数量并核对总数。", "style": "Normal", "font": "Calibri", "font.ea": "Microsoft YaHei", "size": "11pt", "bold": "false", "spaceAfter": "8pt", "lineSpacing": "1.25x", "color": "263648"}}, {"command": "add", "parent": "/body", "type": "paragraph", "props": {"text": "3. 比较不同分区数量的负载，讨论数据倾斜和故障恢复。", "style": "Normal", "font": "Calibri", "font.ea": "Microsoft YaHei", "size": "11pt", "bold": "false", "spaceAfter": "8pt", "lineSpacing": "1.25x", "color": "263648"}}, {"command": "add", "parent": "/body", "type": "paragraph", "props": {"text": "讨论与形成性反馈", "style": "Heading1", "font": "Calibri", "font.ea": "Microsoft YaHei", "size": "18pt", "bold": "true", "spaceAfter": "8pt", "lineSpacing": "1.25x", "color": "17324D"}}, {"command": "add", "parent": "/body", "type": "paragraph", "props": {"text": "提交数据流图与聚合核对表；说明吞吐量、重试与幂等之间的关系。", "style": "Normal", "font": "Calibri", "font.ea": "Microsoft YaHei", "size": "11pt", "bold": "false", "spaceAfter": "8pt", "lineSpacing": "1.25x", "color": "263648"}}, {"command": "add", "parent": "/body", "type": "paragraph", "props": {"text": "演示反馈口径：概念解释、步骤可复核性、证据与结论的一致性。示例分数不计入任何真实课程成绩。", "style": "Normal", "font": "Calibri", "font.ea": "Microsoft YaHei", "size": "11pt", "bold": "false", "spaceAfter": "8pt", "lineSpacing": "1.25x", "color": "263648"}}, {"command": "add", "parent": "/body", "type": "paragraph", "props": {"text": "使用说明", "style": "Heading1", "font": "Calibri", "font.ea": "Microsoft YaHei", "size": "18pt", "bold": "true", "spaceAfter": "8pt", "lineSpacing": "1.25x", "color": "17324D"}}, {"command": "add", "parent": "/body", "type": "paragraph", "props": {"text": "资源标签为理论、讨论或实验、研讨；版本v2保留v1文件。预览与下载由现有账号授权控制。未录制真人、不包含生物识别特征。", "style": "Normal", "font": "Calibri", "font.ea": "Microsoft YaHei", "size": "11pt", "bold": "false", "spaceAfter": "8pt", "lineSpacing": "1.25x", "color": "263648"}}, {"command": "add", "parent": "/", "type": "footer", "props": {"type": "default", "align": "center", "size": "9pt", "text": "合成示例 · ", "field": "page"}}]